      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.naceweb.org/career-readiness/competencies/career-readiness-defined/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NACE, Career readiness competencies</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.naceweb.org/store/2026/creating-meaningful-portfolios-effective-approaches-for-career-readiness/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NACE, Creating Meaningful Portfolios</a>
